WEBVTT

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.160
Begin the raid!

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:19.910
Dorothea?!

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:21.620
What in the world is this?!

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:27.000
We guarantee your safety!
Cooperate with our search!

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:24.200
What's Dorothea doing here?!

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.160
It's Dorothea!

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:27.000
Hands against the wall!

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:30.040
Whoa...

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:31.870
This is horrible!

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:36.330
And the Fairy Weapons were taken away.

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:37.750
Marco Bellwood!

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:44.040
The minister is not here.

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:45.700
Where'd he go?!

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:48.410
You don't need to know that!

00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:49.870
An explosive?!

00:00:49.870 --> 00:00:53.120
Archbishop, I shall fulfill my duty!

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:54.330
Don't!

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:01.290
Red Hood!

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:11.750
Free!

00:01:12.950 --> 00:01:14.660
I'm all right...

00:01:14.660 --> 00:01:16.830
But, why?!

00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:18.410
It's not so bad...

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.790
Risking your life to protect someone...

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:30.870
We Fairy Soldiers... aren't weapons...
or killing tools...

00:01:30.870 --> 00:01:32.160
That's right!

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:37.450
"Episode 20"
"Forest of Beginnings"

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:43.540
They anticipated our move. They even
made off with the Fairy Weapons.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:50.160
We've been able to confirm at
least 20 Fairy Ministry staffers

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:53.120
who disappeared along with
Marco Bellwood and Griff Mercer.

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:55.410
They're probably all together.

00:01:55.410 --> 00:01:57.790
The Eins Order.

00:01:57.790 --> 00:02:03.500
It's the name of an old religious order that
faded into the shadows of history long ago.

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:07.500
Marco Bellwood is its leader, the archbishop.

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:12.620
We can expect the likes of Griff Mercer
and Wolfran Row to be his lieutenants.

00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:15.830
Bellwood and his men had important
positions at the Ministry of Fairies,

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:21.200
and Wolfran wore a mafia disguise,
but it was all a fiction.

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:25.120
Their true identity was that of the Eins Order.

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:28.120
And their goal is...

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:32.290
...to revive the Divine Beast.

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:33.410
That's right.

00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:39.750
Now that the order has the <i>Black Fairy Tome</i>,
they must know how it's done.

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:43.870
All they need to do now
is gather the two elements.

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:45.660
A fusion...

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:48.660
...and a fairy-possessed fairy organ.

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:51.830
Director.

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:56.410
There's something I want to tell everyone.

00:02:57.830 --> 00:03:04.250
I am... not a Fairy Soldier who
received a fairy organ via transplant.

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:09.290
A fairy possessed me directly.
I am fairy-possessed.

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:20.830
Even so, you're still you.

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:24.290
This doesn't change anything.

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:26.500
Yeah, things are still the same.

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:31.370
Thank you, everyone.

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:33.870
Oh, but hey.

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:38.870
If you're fairy-possessed,
you're an element of the Divine Beast.

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:41.080
Which means, isn't the order
going to come after you?

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:44.160
It's been kept secret that
she's fairy-possessed.

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:46.620
Not even you guys knew, did you?

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:49.830
Is there anyone else who's fairy-possessed?

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:53.040
We only know of two others, besides me.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:57.120
Veronica Thorn, and the
Duke of Kal-o, Ray Dawn.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:04:02.000
We'll urge Duke Kal-o to be cautious, and place
him under guard if it comes down to it.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:03.910
But as for Veronica Thorn...

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:07.200
I'm not sure of her whereabouts either.

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:09.830
First, we'd have to find her.

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:16.040
I've spent time personally
investigating the order,

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:19.750
so I think I can offer some useful information.

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:24.790
Would that useful info
let us track down the order?

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:27.620
Sorry, that much I can't know.

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:34.040
One thing at a time. Twenty people
can't all hide without leaving any trace.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.540
There must be clues.

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:38.830
It won't just be we of Dorothea.

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:41.500
The military, the police, the Security Bureau...

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:47.580
Unified Zesskia will devote all its resources
to shutting down the Eins Order's plot.

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:51.040
Leave no stone unturned until you find them!

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.250
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:01.000
What's the situation?

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:07.540
There's no sign that Bellwood or the rest that
appear to be part of Eins got on or off any trains.

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:10.290
Rondacia is a big place, you know.

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:14.330
All the agencies are working together on this.

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:16.450
We'll find them.

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:21.540
We'll just have to investigate
the hometowns, family,

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:24.250
and friends of Bellwood and his lieutenants.

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:25.700
Yeah, really.

00:05:29.540 --> 00:05:32.790
Now, eyewitness information
on the order is all in one place.

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:36.830
It's listed in priority from the top down.

00:05:39.450 --> 00:05:46.290
According to documents you guys confiscated,
while Bellwood and Griff worked at the ministry,

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:49.540
they went on frequent long-distance trips.

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:53.950
They also visited a number of
places while on long-term leave.

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:59.540
Priority, huh?

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:03.160
This destination of Bellwood's, Branhut.

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:05.450
That's where Wolfran's from.

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:09.200
And then, Fuzan. He stayed
there an awfully long time.

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:12.200
Looks like he was meeting
with a man named Olek.

00:06:12.200 --> 00:06:14.080
This seems fishy, too.

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:15.040
Olek...

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:17.700
This one says Isharat.

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:21.750
Looks like Griff lived there as a child.

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:27.330
Yes. It seems he lost his parents early on,
and was raised by other relatives.

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:30.500
After that, Bellwood took him in.

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:33.080
All right, we'll split these up!

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:34.950
Yes, sir.

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:37.120
One thing at a time, right?

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:38.330
Yeah.

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:44.410
Maybe someone here has seen a suspect.

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:46.750
We might not turn up anything, though.

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:52.120
Even if this is a dead end, it's still
positive if you view it as progress.

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:54.410
That's admirable, Klara.

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:58.450
It's nothing like that.
I'm just too proud to give up.

00:06:58.450 --> 00:07:01.200
Yeah, that side of you...

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:05.950
Let's make some progress.

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:07.160
Right.

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:15.000
It's rainin' now.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:16.450
It sure is.

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:20.790
So, when did you last see Wolfran?

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:25.000
Oh, I guess about half a year back.

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:27.450
That was quite a while ago.

00:07:27.450 --> 00:07:31.580
When did this town wind up like this?

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:33.410
During the War of Unification.

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:38.250
Not long before Ledrad surrendered,
and Wolfran came home.

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:41.870
The Cidal army attacked the town.

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:45.580
That was when his wife and daughter were...

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:49.250
Wolfran... It's not just your family.

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:51.410
It's the same for all of us.

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:55.500
What did I fight for?

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:58.580
What did they die for?

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:02.040
What did I kill so many with these hands for?!

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:03.250
I can't--

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:09.000
What was it for?!

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:13.660
Looks like he spent a lot of time searching.

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:18.830
But in the end, no remains of his wife
or daughter were ever found.

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:23.410
There isn't a single hair
from them in these graves.

00:08:29.830 --> 00:08:33.370
Wolfran showed no interest
in moving from this spot.

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:36.620
But then a man came from somewhere,
and spoke to him.

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:41.700
I think he was supposed
to be on some pilgrimage.

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:52.160
Who are you?

00:08:55.370 --> 00:08:59.250
Is the man you just mentioned this guy?

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:03.330
Yeah, that's him.

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:06.160
He and Wolfran were deep in talk for a while.

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:08.910
Then, the two of them went off somewhere.

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:13.370
That was the last time you saw this man?

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:18.500
Strangers stand out around these parts.

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:22.660
If Wolfran came home, somebody would notice.

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:24.750
I imagine so.

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:27.370
We appreciate your cooperation.

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:34.910
Well, when he was a kid, he couldn't
even bring himself to kill a bug.

00:09:34.910 --> 00:09:37.700
This never would've happened,
if not for the war.

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:50.870
Wolfran Row!

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:54.290
It'll look suspicious if this lasts long,
so please make it quick.

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:55.540
All right.

00:09:57.410 --> 00:09:59.370
The will of the fairies.

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:03.000
Why?

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:07.620
You want to know why I'm living in disgrace?

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:11.200
It's because there's something
I absolutely must tell you.

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:12.500
Say it.

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:19.750
There's a fairy-possessed in Dorothea.

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:27.160
Marlya Noel. She burned my fairy away
to nothing, and took away my fairy organ!

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:34.700
Also, her humanoid fairy...
That's fairy possession!

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:36.950
I thought so.

00:10:36.950 --> 00:10:40.620
The more candidates we have
for elements, the better.

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:43.660
I'll be sure to tell the archbishop.

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:53.910
If I drink this drug,
it will look like a natural death?

00:10:53.910 --> 00:10:54.870
Yeah.

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:59.450
Now, at last...

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:03.160
Michel Connor. You've done well.

00:11:15.290 --> 00:11:18.120
I'm not really sure.

00:11:18.120 --> 00:11:19.700
All right.

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:21.540
Thank you.

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:22.790
No problem.

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:29.080
Five years ago, Bellwood and Griff
were with the ministry,

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:32.120
but what could they have
been doing here in Fuzan?

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:38.330
Olek, the man with whom they were
allegedly meeting, might know.

00:11:40.790 --> 00:11:42.500
Does that ring a bell?

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:46.080
Well, that name... Just maybe...

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:50.540
No, it might be my imagination.

00:11:54.830 --> 00:11:56.870
Huh? What was that?

00:11:56.870 --> 00:11:59.200
A man named Olek.

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:00.910
Do you know him?

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:02.290
Olek?

00:12:02.290 --> 00:12:05.200
Hmm, Olek...

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:07.830
Oh, you mean Olek Gunnar!

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:10.290
Do you know where he is now?

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:14.370
That guy disappeared ages ago,
and I haven't seen him since.

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:18.120
I see.

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:20.540
Thank you.

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:21.870
Olek Gunnar.

00:12:21.870 --> 00:12:23.200
Let's look elsewhere.

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:24.330
Free!

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:29.200
I might know where he is.

00:12:42.540 --> 00:12:43.830
Olek...

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.830
You're Olek the guardian, aren't you?

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:54.830
Do you recognize me? I'm Marlya!

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:56.870
Marlya... Noel?

00:12:56.870 --> 00:13:00.700
Yes. You survived.

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:02.450
I'm glad!

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:06.580
"Fairy village Suna guardian: Olek Gunnar"

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:06.040
And you survived too?

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:10.790
I was shot by Ray Dawn's soldiers,
and nearly died.

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:13.910
I'm not sure it's a good thing I survived.

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:15.750
Of course it is!

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:19.450
Olek, here you are now!

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:28.700
Olek. As you can see, we're with Dorothea.

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:31.040
We're tackling an important case.

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:34.250
Will you talk to us?

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:36.910
All right.

00:13:36.910 --> 00:13:39.540
It promises to be a long talk.

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:41.160
Let's not discuss it here.

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:51.450
Your father Ivan was a
better guardian than I was.

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:53.040
Dad...

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:58.200
There's a place I want to show you.
Come with me.

00:14:06.870 --> 00:14:09.500
This forest was burned down too, huh?

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:12.580
It was over a decade ago, though.

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:17.370
Unlike houses built by people,
forests naturally revive.

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:21.410
It's just, there must not be
any fairies here anymore.

00:14:21.410 --> 00:14:26.080
It's said fairies will never return to a
forest burned down by human hands.

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:27.700
It's true.

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:32.370
I don't see any fairy primordials.
There used to be so many of them.

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:35.450
You can see fairies with the naked eye?

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:41.830
Well, I'm fairy-possessed.

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:48.290
As a Suna guardian, you must
know about fairy possession.

00:14:48.290 --> 00:14:52.580
I'm not a guardian anymore. I'm just a recluse.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:03.540
Fairy imaginals--beasts possessed by fairies--
are the apex of an ecosystem.

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:08.330
However, they won't go around
devouring beasts for no reason.

00:15:08.330 --> 00:15:11.950
Fairy imaginals maintain balance in a forest.

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:14.500
What about the fairy-possessed, like me?

00:15:15.580 --> 00:15:21.040
The fairy-possessed existed long before
Fairy Soldiers were ever produced.

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:28.910
You could say they're a bridge between humanity
and the natural world: fairies; beasts; forests.

00:15:28.910 --> 00:15:35.330
But there are fewer and fewer
fairy primordials in this world.

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:37.910
People make mistakes.

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:44.580
The ancient kingdom of Tupal tried to exert
its will over fairies, and it perished.

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:46.370
The Divine Beast...

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:50.160
That's a misnomer. It's no god.

00:15:50.160 --> 00:15:53.620
Instead, it's a devil devised by man.

00:15:53.620 --> 00:15:58.620
Legend has it that the fairy-possessed
who were going to be used

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:02.000
by the king of Tupal escaped
and settled in this land.

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:04.450
That was the origin of Suna.

00:16:04.450 --> 00:16:09.000
That's why those born in Suna are
predisposed to fairy possession?

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:15.700
Even Ray Dawn snuck into the forest as a boy,
and became fairy-possessed.

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:20.540
The fairy-possessed are a bridge between
people and the natural world.

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:25.250
But if they use their fairy for evil ends,
they can become a serious threat.

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:30.750
I won't be one! Not even
the fairies want such a thing!

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:36.580
You can hear fairy voices?
I've heard of such legends.

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:41.750
If Ver could hear fairy voices,
she'd never try for revenge.

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:42.950
Ver?

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:45.160
The blessed child, Veronica?

00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:47.160
Ver is fairy-possessed, too.

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:49.080
She's alive as well?

00:16:50.290 --> 00:16:54.120
Talk about ironic.

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:59.410
If Suna hadn't burned, and that fairy
had rampaged in the forest again,

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:03.160
Veronica would have been offered as a sacrifice!

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:05.830
What do you mean? A sacrifice?

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:09.290
I was called a cursed child for so long.

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:13.330
Wouldn't I be the one offered as a sacrifice?!

00:17:13.330 --> 00:17:18.080
The way she brought happiness to everyone,
had such a promising future...

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:22.950
Everyone envied her, that's what
made her worthy of being a sacrifice.

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:26.370
Not one who brings misfortune.

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:28.580
Meaning, if you're going to give a gift,

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:32.750
it has to be something dear to you,
not something you don't need?

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:36.950
Sorry, but that's how it was ordained.

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:38.700
It was a law, huh?

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:41.580
I'm sorry.

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:45.910
Let's go. It's up ahead.

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:55.620
Five years ago, I was asked to guide
some men claiming to be fairy scholars.

00:17:55.620 --> 00:17:59.580
Bellwood... I do recall that name.

00:17:59.580 --> 00:18:01.870
I was making a terrible living.

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:06.040
Poverty led me to say things
I never should have.

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:10.540
Such as, maybe there were still
fairies deep in Suna's forest.

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:12.750
I wouldn't shut up about it.

00:18:16.290 --> 00:18:19.500
Were there fairies here?

00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:24.500
One was. It used to appear in the
forest and rampage around.

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:29.580
That horrifying Esteemed One, who would
cannibalize other fairy imaginals.

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:36.290
Marlya. The Esteemed One got your father, too.

00:18:36.290 --> 00:18:39.160
My father, too?

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:41.250
It's all my fault.

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:44.330
I...

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:48.080
But I didn't think it would
really still be here.

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:51.080
They captured the Esteemed One.

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:53.370
Wait a minute. Cannibalize?

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:56.120
Doesn't that make it a fusion?

00:18:56.120 --> 00:18:58.540
An element of the Divine Beast...

00:18:58.540 --> 00:18:59.700
Hey!

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:03.330
Hey, you!

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:06.410
They captured a fusion?!

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:08.250
Fusion?

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:12.540
You mean the Esteemed One? In that case, yes.

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:16.620
Bellwood's group carried the
Esteemed One away from here.

00:19:19.410 --> 00:19:22.250
I really am sorry.

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:23.790
This is bad news.

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:26.250
Let's hurry back!

00:19:26.250 --> 00:19:27.450
Yes, sir.

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:39.830
I wish there'd been a town nearby.

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:42.540
We're just resting until the sun comes up.

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:43.750
True.

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:49.000
You drove all that way,
you must be more tired than I am.

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:51.160
Why not get some sleep inside?

00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:52.750
Yeah.

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:53.950
And you?

00:19:53.950 --> 00:19:58.910
I want to sort things out in my head a bit more.

00:19:58.910 --> 00:20:02.080
Okay. Don't get too bogged down.

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:03.330
I won't.

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:13.750
Fairy possession, the Divine Beast...
What's it all mean?

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:16.580
Am I something dreadful?

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:20.040
Lightning bugs.

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:24.330
I saw some with Ver.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:35.950
Long ago, I used to wonder if I was the
most unfortunate person in the world.

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:42.120
Ver's radiant kindness gave me hope.

00:20:43.330 --> 00:20:47.200
We both became fairy-possessed.

00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:51.660
I have comrades.

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:54.370
But... Ver is alone.

00:20:57.500 --> 00:21:00.500
Ver has nobody but me.

00:21:00.500 --> 00:21:02.540
I have to protect her!

00:21:05.500 --> 00:21:06.870
Free?

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:11.870
Sorry, I'm not him.

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:13.750
Wolfran Row!

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:15.750
Fairy-possessed.

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:20.080
You're necessary in order to end it all!

00:22:51.450 --> 00:22:53.410
"Prime Minister's Official Residence"

00:23:05.250 --> 00:23:08.290
What report is it this time? Go on, enter!

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:14.250
You're...!

00:23:14.250 --> 00:23:17.160
You're working hard, Prime Minister.

00:23:17.160 --> 00:23:19.830
Griff Mercer! How?!

00:23:19.830 --> 00:23:21.870
It is the will of the fairies.

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:30.120
Please die a miserable death.

00:23:30.120 --> 00:23:34.200
So that we may save this world!

00:23:39.160 --> 00:23:41.120
We will protect Marlya!

00:23:41.120 --> 00:23:43.790
Pay no heed to the voices of fairies.

00:23:43.790 --> 00:23:45.750
Who can I fight?

00:23:45.750 --> 00:23:48.410
I won't run away!

00:23:45.910 --> 00:23:48.410
"Next time"
"Rusted Warrior and Unopening Door"
